WEBVTT

1
00:00:37.829 --> 00:00:41.958
MY BELOVED DEMON

2
00:00:48.214 --> 00:00:51.050
FINANCIAL HEAD OF THE GROUP MR. CHA
FOUND HANGING IN THE DRESSING ROOM

3
00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:37.806
Jung Koo Won?

4
00:01:47.524 --> 00:01:49.400
You have something very dear to me.

5
00:01:51.069 --> 00:01:52.737
I want you to be more responsible.

6
00:01:59.953 --> 00:02:00.829
Acid?

7
00:02:01.412 --> 00:02:02.455
You…

8
00:02:18.388 --> 00:02:20.515
It didn't occur to me then.

9
00:02:23.143 --> 00:02:24.102
What…

10
00:02:25.186 --> 00:02:26.563
are you like that

11
00:02:29.190 --> 00:02:30.191
I…

12
00:02:32.026 --> 00:02:32.902
the demon

13
00:02:35.572 --> 00:02:37.115
You people call me…

14
00:02:39.033 --> 00:02:40.076
the devil

15
00:02:58.761 --> 00:03:05.184
EPISODE 3
JOIN FORCES WITH THE DEMON

16
00:03:14.777 --> 00:03:17.113
{\an8}We analyzed the liquid on the ground,

17
00:03:18.656 --> 00:03:21.117
{\an8}and it turned out to be sulfuric acid.

18
00:03:21.701 --> 00:03:24.621
{\an8}If so much acid of such concentration
hit your face

19
00:03:24.704 --> 00:03:26.497
{\an8}she would melt it and you would die.

20
00:03:27.457 --> 00:03:31.336
{\an8}It is likely that you are a target.

21
00:03:31.920 --> 00:03:33.254
{\an8}Do you suspect anyone?

22
00:03:35.173 --> 00:03:37.759
<i>I Cha Tae Chun,
head of the financial department of Mire Group.</i>

23
00:03:38.801 --> 00:03:41.763
<i>I am calling to inform you of important information.</i>

24
00:03:42.513 --> 00:03:44.682
Does anyone remember?

25
00:03:45.433 --> 00:03:46.267
No.

26
00:03:46.351 --> 00:03:49.729
I can't remember anyone
who would hate me enough for that.

27
00:04:00.114 --> 00:04:02.033
People are so insignificant.

28
00:04:04.244 --> 00:04:05.745
come in

29
00:04:05.828 --> 00:04:06.955
go

30
00:04:07.038 --> 00:04:08.373
Line up here.

31
00:04:08.456 --> 00:04:09.499
Quick!

32
00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:13.211
Are homeless people allowed in casinos now?

33
00:04:13.294 --> 00:04:14.754
They have bad business.

34
00:04:16.214 --> 00:04:17.382
Where do you think you are?

35
00:04:17.465 --> 00:04:20.176
Ahead! You can't do that with a woman!

36
00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:22.345
If you are in such a hurry, I will question you first.

37
00:04:22.428 --> 00:04:23.846
Sit down, everyone.

38
00:04:24.806 --> 00:04:25.723
sit down

39
00:04:25.807 --> 00:04:27.392
What is your ID card number?

40
00:04:28.309 --> 00:04:31.229
Drink this while you wait, sir.

41
00:04:31.312 --> 00:04:33.273
I don't drink that kind of slop.

42
00:04:33.356 --> 00:04:35.608
You with your contempt.

43
00:04:35.692 --> 00:04:37.443
Did you live abroad or something?

44
00:04:37.527 --> 00:04:40.071
Get it right.
I'm older than I look.

45
00:04:40.613 --> 00:04:43.324
Of course. Okay, fine.

46
00:04:44.117 --> 00:04:45.451
VERIFICATION OF PERSONAL DATA

47
00:04:46.619 --> 00:04:47.453
Her name means "lady".

48
00:04:47.537 --> 00:04:49.038
{\an8}NAME: NO SUK NYO
ADDRESS: UNKNOWN

49
00:04:54.919 --> 00:04:57.130
Why is To To Hee taking so long?

50
00:04:59.465 --> 00:05:00.550
What the hell?

51
00:05:00.633 --> 00:05:02.719
A wonderful aroma of Arabica.

52
00:05:15.356 --> 00:05:17.066
Now you can barely hold on.

53
00:05:19.152 --> 00:05:20.570
You can actually die.

54
00:05:21.321 --> 00:05:22.613
And very...

55
00:05:24.365 --> 00:05:25.408
in a minor way.

56
00:05:33.708 --> 00:05:35.793
Why are there so many crazy people now?

57
00:05:35.877 --> 00:05:36.836
Did you finish?

58
00:05:37.587 --> 00:05:39.088
Did you expect her?

59
00:05:39.172 --> 00:05:40.882
Probably, his presence is reassuring.

60
00:05:42.425 --> 00:05:44.427
Please keep us posted on progress.

61
00:05:44.510 --> 00:05:46.095
Good. Get home safely.

62
00:05:56.022 --> 00:05:57.065
do not think

63
00:05:57.940 --> 00:05:59.442
what should they do?

64
00:06:00.026 --> 00:06:00.902
I highly doubt it.

65
00:06:02.070 --> 00:06:04.655
The roulette wheel is finally spinning.

66
00:06:04.739 --> 00:06:05.615
- Roulette?
- Yes.

67
00:06:08.534 --> 00:06:11.579
I bet everything on an odd number.

68
00:06:18.461 --> 00:06:20.963
Is it so hard to stay safe?

69
00:06:21.047 --> 00:06:23.341
What if I was even a moment late?

70
00:06:23.424 --> 00:06:26.052
My precious tattoo would burn.

71
00:06:26.135 --> 00:06:28.763
So you say you are a demon?

72
00:06:29.806 --> 00:06:32.183
You are the devil.
Why call yourself a demon?

73
00:06:32.266 --> 00:06:33.768
Are you a pokemon?

74
00:06:33.851 --> 00:06:34.769
Poke…

75
00:06:37.230 --> 00:06:38.189
Listen carefully.

76
00:06:38.272 --> 00:06:42.235
A demon is an extremely noble being,
whose purpose is to make deals with people.

77
00:06:43.319 --> 00:06:44.904
What are the deals?

78
00:06:44.987 --> 00:06:48.241
To put it simply, I fulfill people's wishes.

79
00:06:48.825 --> 00:06:52.078
- Like a genie from a lamp?
- Don't compare me to a chubby smurf.

80
00:06:52.954 --> 00:06:56.040
You have seen what I am capable of.
If I'm not a demon, then who am I?

81
00:06:56.124 --> 00:06:58.251
We usually call such
like you superhumans.

82
00:06:58.334 --> 00:07:00.586
Forget it. Think what you want.

83
00:07:00.670 --> 00:07:03.381
- Then you are definitely a genie from...
- Besides that.

84
00:07:03.464 --> 00:07:04.799
to be honest

85
00:07:04.882 --> 00:07:07.635
I don't care if you're a devil or an angel.

86
00:07:07.718 --> 00:07:10.596
- You don't believe me.
- That's not the point.

87
00:07:10.680 --> 00:07:13.266
The point is that you own it
amazing powers

88
00:07:13.349 --> 00:07:15.810
and that I have your dad
which is the source of them all.

89
00:07:16.644 --> 00:07:17.478
Then you don't believe.

90
00:07:18.229 --> 00:07:20.064
No.

91
00:07:20.148 --> 00:07:21.607
I knew that.

92
00:07:21.691 --> 00:07:24.068
You people are forever in doubt.

93
00:07:24.152 --> 00:07:27.113
And I was interested in
why are you so obsessed with your tat?

94
00:07:34.287 --> 00:07:36.956
It must have been difficult for you.

95
00:07:37.582 --> 00:07:39.959
You should be by my side
to use forces

96
00:07:40.042 --> 00:07:41.502
but you have no reason for it.

97
00:07:41.586 --> 00:07:43.463
You are not my ex, not that you are not a boyfriend.

98
00:07:44.088 --> 00:07:45.631
It seems that you need it now

99
00:07:45.715 --> 00:07:48.259
a reason that will give you
the right to be near me.

100
00:07:48.342 --> 00:07:50.470
- I'm wrong.
- What are you trying to say?

101
00:07:51.220 --> 00:07:54.056
We share the same fate.

102
00:07:54.140 --> 00:07:55.892
That's what I'm trying to say.

103
00:07:56.893 --> 00:07:57.768
Same fate?

104
00:07:57.852 --> 00:07:59.729
We are now in the same boat.

105
00:07:59.812 --> 00:08:01.731
There is a way for both of us to win in this situation.

106
00:08:01.814 --> 00:08:02.773
Which one exactly?

107
00:08:04.025 --> 00:08:06.027
You will be my bodyguard.

108
00:08:06.110 --> 00:08:07.820
A bodyguard? What are you talking about?

109
00:08:08.946 --> 00:08:10.740
Let me explain to you in detail.

110
00:08:10.823 --> 00:08:12.825
A security guard is a person
which protects the client…

111
00:08:12.909 --> 00:08:15.495
I know what a security guard does.

112
00:08:15.578 --> 00:08:16.829
I am a demon.

113
00:08:16.913 --> 00:08:19.540
You tell me to protect
some insignificant person?

114
00:08:20.124 --> 00:08:21.250
You can tell yourself

115
00:08:21.334 --> 00:08:23.753
that you protect instead
your precious tattoo.

116
00:08:23.836 --> 00:08:25.671
- No.
- If you don't want to protect,

117
00:08:25.755 --> 00:08:27.215
watch out for the fight against the villains.

118
00:08:27.298 --> 00:08:29.258
Do you want me to fight for you?

119
00:08:29.342 --> 00:08:31.385
Do you really think I'm a pokemon?

120
00:08:31.469 --> 00:08:33.804
You'll be in trouble if I die, right?

121
00:08:34.388 --> 00:08:36.098
What will happen to my dad if I die?

122
00:08:39.852 --> 00:08:41.020
As you know

123
00:08:41.771 --> 00:08:42.897
now i'm in danger

124
00:08:43.481 --> 00:08:45.775
I don't know who is hunting me and why

125
00:08:45.858 --> 00:08:47.610
but someone wants to kill me.

126
00:08:48.903 --> 00:08:50.947
you need your tattoo

127
00:08:51.030 --> 00:08:52.823
and I need your strength.

128
00:08:52.907 --> 00:08:55.785
It's the only way we both get what we want.

129
00:08:55.868 --> 00:08:56.786
Do not agree?

130
00:09:18.391 --> 00:09:20.810
- Will you be my bodyguard?
- My answer is a firm no.

131
00:09:22.270 --> 00:09:24.689
What do you offer? Do you have a better idea?

132
00:09:27.233 --> 00:09:29.026
I don't know, but I won't be your bodyguard.

133
00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:36.826
- Where are you?
- That scoundrel can try again.

134
00:09:36.909 --> 00:09:38.202
I'll take you to the door.

135
00:09:38.286 --> 00:09:40.788
That's what a security guard does.
It's not too difficult.

136
00:09:40.871 --> 00:09:43.291
I say that I will never be your bodyguard.

137
00:09:44.208 --> 00:09:46.502
Stand before me. I'll cover your back.

138
00:09:47.712 --> 00:09:49.213
What is the security here?

139
00:09:50.464 --> 00:09:51.966
Can't you hear yourself?

140
00:10:41.307 --> 00:10:43.851
"SUNVOL FOUNDATION"

141
00:10:51.150 --> 00:10:52.318
I'm amazing at how…

142
00:10:53.110 --> 00:10:54.612
Oh, I'm sorry.

143
00:10:56.072 --> 00:10:57.281
Maybe not.

144
00:11:01.827 --> 00:11:02.745
Just think:

145
00:11:02.828 --> 00:11:06.290
my amazing powers depend on my wrist
such an insignificant and weak person.

146
00:11:07.416 --> 00:11:08.834
If he breaks into her home?

147
00:11:08.918 --> 00:11:10.836
If she dies, I'll lose my strength forever

148
00:11:10.920 --> 00:11:13.005
how do I make deals then?

149
00:11:13.089 --> 00:11:15.341
So be her guardian,
if you are so worried.

150
00:11:15.424 --> 00:11:16.717
don't make me laugh

151
00:11:16.801 --> 00:11:18.886
How can a demon become a guardian?

152
00:11:18.969 --> 00:11:20.721
Demons were guardians.

153
00:11:20.805 --> 00:11:22.848
What kind of delusion is this?

154
00:11:23.849 --> 00:11:25.976
DEMONS FIRST
EXISTED AMONG PEOPLE

155
00:11:26.060 --> 00:11:28.687
AND PROTECTED THEM AS GUARDIANS

156
00:11:28.771 --> 00:11:30.231
Keepers are actually guards.

157
00:11:30.314 --> 00:11:32.441
I don't want to be either.

158
00:11:32.525 --> 00:11:34.652
I was made to be a demon.

159
00:11:35.569 --> 00:11:37.571
How did you even get it?

160
00:11:39.115 --> 00:11:40.658
I was cleaning your table.

161
00:11:40.741 --> 00:11:42.076
by the way

162
00:11:42.159 --> 00:11:45.454
what if To To Hee gets confused about who you are?

163
00:11:45.538 --> 00:11:47.665
She doesn't even believe I'm a demon.

164
00:11:48.249 --> 00:11:50.751
And you know what people are like.

165
00:11:54.463 --> 00:11:58.968
I saw the devil.

166
00:11:59.051 --> 00:12:01.387
- Just a little.
- Lord.

167
00:12:03.264 --> 00:12:05.975
What did the devil look like?

168
00:12:06.809 --> 00:12:09.687
The devil appeared before me

169
00:12:10.271 --> 00:12:13.941
<i>in the image of the man of my dreams,
to tempt my soul.</i>

170
00:12:15.151 --> 00:12:18.487
<i>Turned proportionate nose.</i>

171
00:12:19.280 --> 00:12:20.948
Porcelain-smooth skin.

172
00:12:21.449 --> 00:12:23.576
Sexy but innocent lips.

173
00:12:24.326 --> 00:12:25.244
And most importantly,

174
00:12:25.327 --> 00:12:27.204
he had a melancholy look.

175
00:12:27.288 --> 00:12:29.999
Even his voice was music to me.

176
00:12:31.167 --> 00:12:32.168
{\an8}In the end I am

177
00:12:32.668 --> 00:12:36.464
fell in love with the devil.

178
00:12:51.187 --> 00:12:52.771
No one will believe that I exist

179
00:12:53.272 --> 00:12:54.815
and soon everyone will forget

180
00:12:55.816 --> 00:12:57.318
that they have heard about me at all.

181
00:12:57.902 --> 00:12:58.736
You are right.

182
00:12:58.819 --> 00:13:02.406
In a past life, I was well beaten
for saying he saw an evil spirit.

183
00:13:02.490 --> 00:13:05.201
My buttocks still hurt when it rains.

184
00:13:05.284 --> 00:13:08.287
You exaggerate.
It wasn't even in this life.

185
00:13:08.370 --> 00:13:12.333
Then my strength will really disappear,
if To To Hee dies?

186
00:13:12.416 --> 00:13:14.460
I don't mind. That's why I'm so nervous.

187
00:13:14.543 --> 00:13:15.878
Something bad could happen.

188
00:13:16.712 --> 00:13:19.965
That damn instruction is full of threats
and no useful information.

189
00:13:20.049 --> 00:13:22.176
You should just throw it away and...

190
00:13:23.385 --> 00:13:25.471
No, it's not worth it.

191
00:13:25.554 --> 00:13:26.805
Do you recognize this as an instruction?

192
00:13:28.682 --> 00:13:33.145
I just want to give back
his peaceful and comfortable life.

193
00:13:33.229 --> 00:13:35.356
I just want to live forever

194
00:13:35.439 --> 00:13:37.900
flawless predator,
that never ages or dies.

195
00:13:38.901 --> 00:13:40.152
Am I asking too much?

196
00:13:42.071 --> 00:13:44.073
- You won't hide it?
- You will find it anyway.

197
00:13:45.324 --> 00:13:46.825
I really enjoy the challenge.

198
00:13:55.793 --> 00:13:56.877
Seriously…

199
00:14:01.257 --> 00:14:02.424
<i>Be my bodyguard.</i>

200
00:14:02.925 --> 00:14:04.093
How annoying.

201
00:14:04.176 --> 00:14:06.512
<i>Should I go get laser tattoo removal?</i>

202
00:14:06.595 --> 00:14:08.681
Is she threatening a demon now?

203
00:14:08.764 --> 00:14:10.432
<i>I booked a laser.</i>

204
00:14:10.516 --> 00:14:12.101
<i>Removal will begin in five, four,</i>

205
00:14:12.184 --> 00:14:13.310
<i>three, two, one.</i>

206
00:14:13.394 --> 00:14:15.980
<i>- I killed Pororo's tattoo.</i>
- She's crazy!

207
00:14:21.694 --> 00:14:22.528
She's so crazy

208
00:14:24.822 --> 00:14:27.867
{\an8}PHOTO SENT

209
00:14:27.950 --> 00:14:29.159
{\an8}He doesn't bite.

210
00:14:53.517 --> 00:14:55.019
He saved me again.

211
00:14:57.187 --> 00:14:59.690
Like last time.

212
00:15:01.400 --> 00:15:04.945
<i>Mr. Cha, Head of Finance of Mire Group
accused of misappropriation of money,</i>

213
00:15:05.029 --> 00:15:07.031
<i>was found dead during the day.</i>

214
00:15:07.114 --> 00:15:10.993
A passer-by found his body
in a public toilet near his house</i>

215
00:15:11.076 --> 00:15:12.703
<i>and reported about it around 2:00 p.m.</i>

216
00:15:16.665 --> 00:15:18.751
MY GENTLE FLOWER

217
00:15:22.838 --> 00:15:25.674
Why are you so clingy?
You saw me only a day ago.

218
00:15:26.258 --> 00:15:28.302
I know you are happy to call me.

219
00:15:28.385 --> 00:15:29.970
Are you calling to boil me down?

220
00:15:30.054 --> 00:15:31.847
That's not why I'm calling.

221
00:15:32.598 --> 00:15:36.143
Is everything okay in your company now?

222
00:15:36.226 --> 00:15:37.227
In my company?

223
00:15:37.811 --> 00:15:38.646
And what?

224
00:15:39.355 --> 00:15:43.943
I saw on the news
that your head of finance has hanged himself.

225
00:15:45.861 --> 00:15:49.239
The thing is that he is mine
called yesterday and said

226
00:15:49.823 --> 00:15:51.408
<i>that he has important information.</i>

227
00:15:53.994 --> 00:15:56.830
I neglected it
I thought he just wanted money.

228
00:15:56.914 --> 00:15:58.540
But after his suicide

229
00:15:59.458 --> 00:16:01.043
it seems to me that something is wrong.

230
00:16:02.878 --> 00:16:05.798
And you should not worry
about your own company?

231
00:16:05.881 --> 00:16:07.299
<i>It's empty.</i>

232
00:16:07.383 --> 00:16:09.385
<i>Then blow your nose
and focus on your company.</i>

233
00:16:21.480 --> 00:16:22.606
Mrs. Yun.

234
00:16:23.148 --> 00:16:26.151
Bring me all the articles
about the deceased financial head

235
00:16:26.235 --> 00:16:28.278
and financial statements for the last ten years

236
00:16:29.196 --> 00:16:31.281
and for headquarters,
and for subsidiaries.

237
00:16:59.101 --> 00:17:01.270
All this time I was blind.

238
00:17:07.026 --> 00:17:09.069
Good morning, Director Chong.

239
00:17:09.153 --> 00:17:10.821
come in

240
00:17:11.905 --> 00:17:14.199
You seem to be in a good mood today.

241
00:17:15.576 --> 00:17:19.163
I just realized
maybe the situation is not too bad.

242
00:17:19.246 --> 00:17:22.499
My dad hasn't disappeared.
It is safe on that woman's wrist.

243
00:17:23.083 --> 00:17:25.794
You are a positive person.

244
00:17:25.878 --> 00:17:28.964
And I realized
that I couldn't get my dad back

245
00:17:29.048 --> 00:17:31.050
- by a simple jump into the water.
- And what?

246
00:17:31.133 --> 00:17:34.136
The conditions must be the same,
like when i lost him

247
00:17:34.219 --> 00:17:35.763
What are the conditions?

248
00:17:35.846 --> 00:17:37.765
Location, temperature, water, etc.

249
00:17:37.848 --> 00:17:41.435
If the conditions are the same,
I will definitely get my tattoo back.

250
00:17:42.102 --> 00:17:43.520
It is logical.

251
00:17:47.649 --> 00:17:49.568
Do you smell burning?

252
00:17:51.278 --> 00:17:53.572
I roasted the coffee beans to perfection today.

253
00:17:53.655 --> 00:17:54.490
That's not the point.

254
00:17:54.573 --> 00:17:58.285
It's the smell of burning meat, not plants.

255
00:18:00.871 --> 00:18:02.206
You are right.

256
00:18:02.289 --> 00:18:04.333
Smells like grilling a steak.

257
00:18:05.125 --> 00:18:06.960
And I feel the heat.

258
00:18:10.714 --> 00:18:12.841
- Mr. Pak.
- What?

259
00:18:12.925 --> 00:18:13.759
What…

260
00:18:15.010 --> 00:18:17.262
- Is it spontaneous combustion?
- Just like that?

261
00:18:23.602 --> 00:18:25.020
You got your dad back…

262
00:18:26.438 --> 00:18:27.648
What is going on here?

