I thought a little trouble wouldn't hurt.

536
00:36:58.758 --> 00:37:00.635
But what made you change your mind?

537
00:37:00.718 --> 00:37:01.928
You didn't want my power.

538
00:37:03.471 --> 00:37:04.472
Just like that.

539
00:37:05.723 --> 00:37:08.601
Only a scoundrel will deal with a scoundrel.

540
00:37:17.193 --> 00:37:19.237
How did you become a demon?

541
00:37:19.320 --> 00:37:20.905
Were you born with it?

542
00:37:21.405 --> 00:37:22.782
It's a family affair

543
00:37:22.865 --> 00:37:24.742
like a family run restaurant?

544
00:37:24.825 --> 00:37:27.495
Comparing demons to restaurants?
I don't know what…

545
00:37:28.621 --> 00:37:30.122
The language was simply taken away.

546
00:37:31.332 --> 00:37:33.000
How old are you? when were you born

547
00:37:33.709 --> 00:37:35.753
I lived as a demon for 200 years.

548
00:37:37.964 --> 00:37:40.091
You really do look much younger.

549
00:37:41.050 --> 00:37:43.761
So that means there was a time

550
00:37:43.844 --> 00:37:45.304
when were you not a demon?

551
00:37:45.388 --> 00:37:47.723
- I was a person.
- Yes?

552
00:37:47.807 --> 00:37:51.769
Of course I was on another level
compared to the rest of the insignificant people.

553
00:37:52.353 --> 00:37:53.688
But I don't remember that.

554
00:37:53.771 --> 00:37:56.148
I think it's self-hatred.

555
00:37:56.232 --> 00:38:00.278
You think people are insignificant
because they themselves were human.

556
00:38:01.487 --> 00:38:03.072
So it is written in the book.

557
00:38:03.155 --> 00:38:05.616
"God had to
for someone to work in hell

558
00:38:05.700 --> 00:38:08.286
therefore he personally chose a person
to make a demon."

559
00:38:08.369 --> 00:38:11.872
I am the person he chose.

560
00:38:11.956 --> 00:38:13.708
Not because you were special

561
00:38:13.791 --> 00:38:16.168
and because they met the requirements of the job.

562
00:38:17.712 --> 00:38:19.088
You are a scoundrel.

563
00:38:26.220 --> 00:38:28.472
WORDS OF ALMIGHTY CHU:
ENOUGH OF ME. I LOVE YOU SO HEE

564
00:38:28.556 --> 00:38:29.682
What is it now?

565
00:38:29.765 --> 00:38:30.766
ALMIGHTY CHU

566
00:38:37.732 --> 00:38:39.734
<i>The dialed number is not available.</i>

567
00:38:39.817 --> 00:38:41.610
- Turn the car around.
<i>- Leave a message…</i>

568
00:38:48.034 --> 00:38:49.035
Mrs. Chu?

569
00:38:51.245 --> 00:38:52.872
Why are you sitting on the floor?

570
00:38:52.955 --> 00:38:54.749
It will hurt your knee.

571
00:38:54.832 --> 00:38:56.000
I can't believe my eyes.

572
00:39:03.632 --> 00:39:04.633
Mrs. Chu?

573
00:39:05.760 --> 00:39:08.179
MISSED CALLS
FROM MY GENTLE FLOWER

574
00:39:14.060 --> 00:39:16.937
Ms. Chu, are you all right?

575
00:39:21.650 --> 00:39:23.986
Mrs. Chu?

576
00:39:24.070 --> 00:39:25.488
It's not funny.

577
00:39:25.571 --> 00:39:27.656
What's going on?

578
00:39:30.534 --> 00:39:33.412
Ms. Chu, come to your senses.

579
00:39:34.622 --> 00:39:35.623
Ms. Chu.

580
00:39:36.582 --> 00:39:37.875
You can't do that.

581
00:39:37.958 --> 00:39:39.752
It's a joke, right?

582
00:39:40.252 --> 00:39:42.755
you got me through
please come to your senses already.

583
00:39:42.838 --> 00:39:45.174
I'm here

584
00:39:45.257 --> 00:39:48.344
I'm near Please come to your senses.

585
00:39:51.097 --> 00:39:51.931
Enough.

586
00:39:55.184 --> 00:39:56.268
Save her.

587
00:39:58.813 --> 00:40:01.524
I cannot raise the dead.

588
00:40:02.400 --> 00:40:05.403
Why not? I know you can!

589
00:40:05.486 --> 00:40:07.071
Rescue her immediately.

590
00:40:08.364 --> 00:40:09.740
Please save her.

591
00:40:09.824 --> 00:40:12.952
I'll sign a contract or whatever you want
so please

592
00:40:13.702 --> 00:40:14.870
Please save her.

593
00:40:15.371 --> 00:40:17.415
Only this time.

594
00:40:18.707 --> 00:40:19.875
Ms. Chu!

595
00:40:20.835 --> 00:40:22.294
You can't do that.

596
00:40:22.878 --> 00:40:24.630
Come to your senses!

597
00:40:27.174 --> 00:40:28.968
Ms. Chu!

598
00:40:31.512 --> 00:40:33.931
Please save her.

599
00:41:27.943 --> 00:41:31.989
With Ms. To suddenly
the spark of life is gone.

600
00:41:33.115 --> 00:41:34.658
She must be in shock.

601
00:41:34.742 --> 00:41:36.660
She was very close to the head.

602
00:41:38.412 --> 00:41:40.915
Go comfort her?

603
00:41:41.415 --> 00:41:44.168
Futile attempts to console
will only cause her more pain.

604
00:41:44.919 --> 00:41:47.254
Try not to show emotion.

605
00:41:47.338 --> 00:41:49.423
it's better now
what can you do for her

606
00:42:08.859 --> 00:42:11.028
She was always like that.

607
00:42:17.701 --> 00:42:18.786
That's you.

608
00:42:26.001 --> 00:42:27.628
You don't even cry.

609
00:42:30.631 --> 00:42:32.508
I don't deserve to cry.

610
00:42:36.887 --> 00:42:38.556
They died because of me.

611
00:42:42.434 --> 00:42:44.311
So what, it was my birthday?

612
00:42:46.188 --> 00:42:48.357
I shouldn't have rushed them.

613
00:42:55.489 --> 00:42:56.949
Do you consider yourself God?

614
00:42:59.702 --> 00:43:01.954
How can someone die because of you?

615
00:43:03.163 --> 00:43:07.251
you feel sorry for yourself
if you think so, don't you?

616
00:43:08.794 --> 00:43:13.340
You are nothing more than dust
circling in the air.

617
00:43:14.008 --> 00:43:15.801
Dust

618
00:43:16.927 --> 00:43:18.345
cannot outweigh the scales.

619
00:43:48.125 --> 00:43:48.959
That's it.

620
00:43:51.086 --> 00:43:52.296
Well done.

621
00:44:11.523 --> 00:44:13.817
Mom Dad

622
00:44:15.235 --> 00:44:18.113
I miss you.

623
00:44:24.578 --> 00:44:25.454
<i>To Hee.</i>

624
00:44:28.040 --> 00:44:28.874
To Hee

625
00:44:31.043 --> 00:44:33.420
I called you many times
but you didn't answer

626
00:44:36.590 --> 00:44:39.093
Ms. Chu did not like to take pictures.

627
00:44:39.176 --> 00:44:41.261
She said that they never
did not match her beauty.

628
00:44:42.179 --> 00:44:43.472
I think this one is beautiful.

629
00:44:44.181 --> 00:44:45.849
But she is nothing compared to her.

630
00:44:46.975 --> 00:44:50.562
She looks empty with that smile.

631
00:44:51.355 --> 00:44:55.776
Funeral portraits reflect what
bereaved relatives want to remember the deceased.

632
00:44:57.069 --> 00:44:59.863
It still seems like a joke.

633
00:45:00.572 --> 00:45:02.866
It seems that she is about to appear

634
00:45:02.950 --> 00:45:04.952
and shouts: "Surprise, little rascal!"

635
00:45:05.953 --> 00:45:07.830
Then she laughs.

636
00:45:09.081 --> 00:45:11.375
It would really be more like her.

637
00:45:12.459 --> 00:45:14.002
She was so eccentric.

638
00:45:14.670 --> 00:45:16.922
I thought her last moments
will also be special.

639
00:45:18.257 --> 00:45:19.425
But a heart attack?

640
00:45:25.764 --> 00:45:26.682
did you just come

641
00:45:27.683 --> 00:45:30.310
Yes, Aunt Jung Suk, it seems

642
00:45:30.394 --> 00:45:32.604
ordered to create an audit team
before death

643
00:45:32.688 --> 00:45:35.816
It's on hold now
but I had to take care of the papers.

644
00:45:35.899 --> 00:45:37.276
The audit team?

645
00:45:38.152 --> 00:45:39.862
Who delayed it?

646
00:45:39.945 --> 00:45:42.030
The council passed an immediate resolution.

647
00:45:42.114 --> 00:45:43.657
Haven't you heard about it?

648
00:45:45.576 --> 00:45:48.203
Now is not the time for an audit.

649
00:45:49.246 --> 00:45:50.497
Take a look.

650
00:45:50.581 --> 00:45:53.625
Everyone tries to flatter Sook Min.

651
00:45:54.209 --> 00:45:55.919
Is this the Joseon Dynasty or what?

652
00:45:56.003 --> 00:45:57.588
It doesn't matter that he is the eldest son.

653
00:45:58.380 --> 00:46:00.382
Mom never loved Suk Min.

654
00:46:00.466 --> 00:46:03.385
She even sent him behind bars
for driving while intoxicated.

655
00:46:04.428 --> 00:46:05.888
I have a feeling

656
00:46:06.388 --> 00:46:09.391
that mom would make an unexpected choice.
Don't you agree?

657
00:46:09.475 --> 00:46:11.935
Yes. She was truly unique.

658
00:46:13.479 --> 00:46:15.647
Seok Hoon, come over for a minute.

659
00:46:26.283 --> 00:46:28.702
It seems that there has always been between you

660
00:46:30.037 --> 00:46:31.455
a special bond.

661
00:46:32.039 --> 00:46:35.876
The camaraderie of outsiders, right?

662
00:46:35.959 --> 00:46:38.504
We're just together
were students abroad.

663
00:46:38.587 --> 00:46:40.964
But don't kid yourself, To Hee.

664
00:46:41.048 --> 00:46:43.342
Seok Hoon doesn't come from the same background as you.

665
00:46:44.218 --> 00:46:47.596
He comes from the Chu family,

666
00:46:47.679 --> 00:46:50.849
and you are from a poor family

667
00:46:50.933 --> 00:46:54.561
whose members worked with mechanisms
and the hair of others.

668
00:46:54.645 --> 00:46:55.771
nice

669
00:46:57.022 --> 00:46:58.398
you think

670
00:46:59.566 --> 00:47:01.818
Is this the Joseon Dynasty or what?

671
00:47:03.487 --> 00:47:04.988
Are you still snapping at me?

672
00:47:06.240 --> 00:47:08.242
Your mother is gone, there is no one to protect you.

673
00:47:12.913 --> 00:47:16.291
It's time to drink if you don't want to
so that everyone can see who you really are.

674
00:47:16.375 --> 00:47:19.044
I never can
survive a funeral without alcohol.

675
00:47:19.753 --> 00:47:21.380
All in black.

676
00:47:21.463 --> 00:47:22.756
It's terrible.

677
00:47:22.839 --> 00:47:25.509
I put up with far worse things

678
00:47:25.592 --> 00:47:27.344
completely sober.

679
00:47:29.471 --> 00:47:31.431
Mom was always angry.

680
00:47:32.516 --> 00:47:33.475
I think that's why...

681
00:47:35.018 --> 00:47:36.270
you got along with her.

682
00:47:42.901 --> 00:47:44.778
Greetings, Isabelle.

683
00:47:44.861 --> 00:47:46.697
Greetings, long time no see.

684
00:47:48.198 --> 00:47:49.616
I am so glad to see you.

685
00:47:53.704 --> 00:47:55.622
Heard a lot about you from the head Noh.

686
00:47:57.207 --> 00:47:58.625
Of course.

687
00:47:58.709 --> 00:48:00.168
It's still too early to call me that.

688
00:48:00.919 --> 00:48:02.337
Greetings, madam.

689
00:48:02.421 --> 00:48:04.089
Please don't say that.

690
00:48:04.673 --> 00:48:06.466
I'm afraid that's a bit inappropriate.

691
00:48:07.843 --> 00:48:09.469
I think so too.

692
00:48:09.553 --> 00:48:13.432
There are also more and more women heads.

693
00:48:14.016 --> 00:48:15.142
You are right.

694
00:48:17.144 --> 00:48:18.103
Austin!

695
00:48:18.186 --> 00:48:19.062
Justin!

696
00:48:23.650 --> 00:48:25.944
- Austin!
- Boys are like that.

697
00:48:29.406 --> 00:48:30.240
Justin!

698
00:48:45.839 --> 00:48:47.633
So it was a party, not a funeral?

699
00:48:58.518 --> 00:49:03.607
SECURITY

700
00:49:32.678 --> 00:49:36.973
CAMERAS CONTROL ROOM
FOR EMPLOYEES ONLY

701
00:50:31.653 --> 00:50:34.990
The seasons are different under and above the ground.

702
00:50:35.574 --> 00:50:37.492
Underground, spring begins in October.

703
00:50:38.326 --> 00:50:42.122
Although winter is cold on earth,

704
00:50:42.205 --> 00:50:45.625
the buds make their way underground.

705
00:50:47.377 --> 00:50:49.504
So tell yourself that when it's hard.

706
00:50:49.588 --> 00:50:53.133
"Spring is about to bloom in me."

707
00:50:55.385 --> 00:50:58.221
Why is it about Mother Nature?
It doesn't look like you.

708
00:50:59.347 --> 00:51:00.682
Found something.

709
00:51:00.766 --> 00:51:02.517
Just play along, you bastard.

710
00:51:02.601 --> 00:51:04.436
Choose a character and be consistent.

711
00:51:04.519 --> 00:51:06.354
Are you mother nature or lady black mouth?

712
00:51:06.438 --> 00:51:07.564
I'm a black-faced lady, so what?

713
00:51:08.523 --> 00:51:10.442
Just put it here.

714
00:51:10.525 --> 00:51:11.943
God, the water is flowing!

715
00:51:12.027 --> 00:51:14.362
- Oh, just go away.
- What's wrong?

716
00:51:14.446 --> 00:51:15.739
Away!

717
00:51:17.157 --> 00:51:20.577
- You can't spray like that!
- Okay, of course!

718
00:51:39.638 --> 00:51:40.847
I thought there was no one here.

719
00:51:42.474 --> 00:51:43.642
do you want

720
00:51:45.101 --> 00:51:46.895
Mrs. Chu hates the smell of cigarettes.

721
00:51:47.771 --> 00:51:50.065
Grandmother? But she died.

722
00:51:50.941 --> 00:51:52.442
Now everything belongs to my dad

723
00:51:52.526 --> 00:51:54.152
and will soon become mine.

724
00:51:54.236 --> 00:51:56.988
I prefer the smell of cigarettes
and not the smell of an old woman.

725
00:51:58.573 --> 00:52:00.659
I said, Ms. Chu
hates the smell of cigarettes.

726
00:52:03.495 --> 00:52:04.996
Today I will forgive it.

727
00:52:05.622 --> 00:52:06.623
Because today

728
00:52:07.666 --> 00:52:08.917
happy day

729
00:52:13.922 --> 00:52:15.799
I will not forgive it.

730
00:52:23.306 --> 00:52:26.059
I wasn't the only one who wanted to get out of there.

731
00:52:26.685 --> 00:52:27.853
Can I join?

732
00:52:29.062 --> 00:52:30.021
who are you

733
00:52:30.897 --> 00:52:33.775
I am inseparable from Mrs. To To Hee.

734
00:52:34.609 --> 00:52:37.612
But get me right.
I'm not her ex

735
00:52:37.696 --> 00:52:39.072
and definitely not her boyfriend.

736
00:52:39.865 --> 00:52:41.700
- Are you her bodyguard?
- No.

737
00:52:42.534 --> 00:52:43.577
Just finished work.

738
00:52:43.660 --> 00:52:44.703
Would you like a sip?

739
00:52:46.371 --> 00:52:48.290
You can't hide your upbringing.

740
00:52:48.874 --> 00:52:49.916
You are a perfect couple.

741
00:52:56.214 --> 00:52:57.924
What the hell?

742
00:53:02.971 --> 00:53:04.014
Would you like a sip?

743
00:53:12.188 --> 00:53:13.398
Ms. Chu

744
00:53:14.566 --> 00:53:16.109
secluded here

745
00:53:17.193 --> 00:53:19.446
when she felt sad.

746
00:53:23.366 --> 00:53:25.243
I never understood that in her...

747
00:53:27.621 --> 00:53:29.205
until this moment

748
00:53:30.582 --> 00:53:32.626
The greenhouse protected not only her plants,

749
00:53:33.126 --> 00:53:35.337
and Mrs. Chu herself.

750
00:53:37.464 --> 00:53:39.299
She realized…

751
00:53:41.092 --> 00:53:43.637
that her children will be happy

752
00:53:44.137 --> 00:53:45.680
her death

753
00:53:48.808 --> 00:53:50.018
Her prediction came true.

754
00:53:51.269 --> 00:53:53.396
Probably, that's why she was always so evil.

755
00:53:54.731 --> 00:53:56.858
She was lonely all her life

756
00:53:57.609 --> 00:53:59.819
until the last moment.

757
00:54:02.280 --> 00:54:05.492
my heart is breaking
because I couldn't say goodbye to her.

758
00:54:10.914 --> 00:54:14.626
You know why people
do they wear black to funerals?

759
00:54:17.295 --> 00:54:21.049
In order not to allow
souls of the deceased to recognize them and follow them.

760
00:54:22.634 --> 00:54:24.135
That's why

761
00:54:24.636 --> 00:54:26.930
they hide behind black clothes.

762
00:54:28.473 --> 00:54:30.308
Then I'm wearing the wrong color today.

763
00:54:32.936 --> 00:54:35.271
Mrs. Chu must still be so lonely today.

764
00:54:36.898 --> 00:54:39.734
She cannot recognize anyone
at his own funeral.

765
00:55:00.255 --> 00:55:01.673
Now she can recognize you.

766
00:55:04.050 --> 00:55:05.135
What's the point?

767
00:55:06.052 --> 00:55:09.055
I wouldn't know even if I did
she came to see

768
00:55:09.723 --> 00:55:10.932
Just give it a chance.

769
00:56:06.738 --> 00:56:08.531
Thank you Ms. Chu,

770
00:56:09.866 --> 00:56:11.242
that found me

771
00:56:13.161 --> 00:56:15.663
And 17 years ago, and now.

772
00:56:19.626 --> 00:56:21.086
Thanks to you

773
00:56:22.837 --> 00:56:25.340
I could behave as much as I wanted
like a child of the devil.

774
00:56:36.768 --> 00:56:39.229
If we ever have a second chance...

775
00:56:44.442 --> 00:56:45.527
let's fight...

776
00:56:48.947 --> 00:56:50.573
even harder

777
00:56:52.283 --> 00:56:54.369
and let's love each other even more.

778
00:57:26.609 --> 00:57:30.405
A little Are you at a fashion show?

779
00:57:30.488 --> 00:57:32.907
You have to stand out, right?

780
00:57:32.991 --> 00:57:35.535
Aren't we all here like a burnt family?

781
00:57:35.618 --> 00:57:38.413
Who gave her the right to be here?

782
00:57:38.496 --> 00:57:41.875
The detective has information for all of us.

783
00:57:42.876 --> 00:57:44.294
What could it be?

784
00:57:48.715 --> 00:57:49.549
Glad to see you all.

785
00:57:52.886 --> 00:57:54.971
Sorry, it didn't work out.

786
00:57:55.054 --> 00:57:56.556
Whatever it is, let's finish quickly.

787
00:57:56.639 --> 00:57:59.142
It is rude of us to leave guests alone.

788
00:57:59.225 --> 00:58:00.351
Of course, sir.

789
00:58:00.435 --> 00:58:01.519
Detective Lee.

790
00:58:06.357 --> 00:58:08.526
There are too many documents to review.

791
00:58:09.611 --> 00:58:12.989
Did the deceased drink painkillers often?

792
00:58:13.072 --> 00:58:15.450
Yes, she had a knee problem.

793
00:58:15.533 --> 00:58:17.952
The medicine she drank on the day of her death...

794
00:58:19.287 --> 00:58:21.080
it was diclofenac.

795
00:58:21.789 --> 00:58:24.083
Hold on. This is impossible.

796
00:58:24.167 --> 00:58:27.003
She never drank it
because she was allergic to it.

797
00:58:27.587 --> 00:58:30.632
But it is confirmed that before death

798
00:58:30.715 --> 00:58:33.676
she drank exactly diclofenac.

799
00:58:34.344 --> 00:58:37.555
I tell you this
because the pill did not match the label.

800
00:58:37.639 --> 00:58:40.266
You say that mother is dead

801
00:58:40.767 --> 00:58:43.019
due to medical negligence?

802
00:58:43.102 --> 00:58:45.772
We thought it was just a heart attack.

803
00:58:45.855 --> 00:58:48.066
Didn't Director Choi prescribe her medicine?

804
00:58:48.149 --> 00:58:49.526
How could this happen?

805
00:58:49.609 --> 00:58:53.321
We will consider all options,
therefore, let's not rush to conclusions.

806
00:58:54.531 --> 00:58:57.575
<i>Mr Cha and the audit team.</i>

807
00:58:57.659 --> 00:59:00.036
<i>For now, I can only tell you,</i>

808
00:59:00.119 --> 00:59:03.623
what can she do to you
head of "Mire Group".

809
00:59:05.375 --> 00:59:07.126
{\an8}IBUPROFEN

810
00:59:08.378 --> 00:59:10.088
<i>Probably Mr Cha</i>

811
00:59:10.588 --> 00:59:12.298
<i>had evidence of someone's crime.</i>

812
00:59:13.466 --> 00:59:16.386
<i>And this person killed Ms. Chu,</i>

813
00:59:17.595 --> 00:59:19.389
<i>so that she does not dig up anything.</i>

814
00:59:20.807 --> 00:59:22.976
Medical negligence sounds bad.

815
00:59:24.227 --> 00:59:27.438
Especially considering that
that "Mire Group" is in a crisis situation.

816
00:59:27.522 --> 00:59:29.774
We will only give reason for rumours.

817
00:59:30.525 --> 00:59:32.819
One thought about what people will say

818
00:59:33.820 --> 00:59:35.363
gives me a headache

819
00:59:35.446 --> 00:59:38.533
Everyone will eagerly make up stories.

820
00:59:38.616 --> 00:59:41.494
They think we, chaebols,
sold their souls to the devil or something.

821
00:59:42.203 --> 00:59:44.831
How far have our stocks fallen?

822
00:59:44.914 --> 00:59:46.499
They cannot be allowed to fall further.

823
00:59:47.333 --> 00:59:50.503
First, who knew
that the deceased had an allergy

824
00:59:51.421 --> 00:59:52.422
on diclofenac?

825
00:59:52.505 --> 00:59:53.506
Her doctor...

826
00:59:55.800 --> 00:59:57.635
as well as everyone present.

827
01:00:16.237 --> 01:00:17.947
Let's announce that it was a heart attack.

828
01:00:19.157 --> 01:00:20.408
That's a good idea.

829
01:00:20.491 --> 01:00:23.911
We cannot allow rumours
right before imitation.

830
01:00:23.995 --> 01:00:24.954
And again -

831
01:00:25.455 --> 01:00:28.750
we won't bring mom back to life
if we reveal the truth.

832
01:00:30.376 --> 01:00:32.837
I will speak to the Commissioner General.

833
01:00:34.964 --> 01:00:36.924
Make sure it stays a secret.

834
01:00:41.429 --> 01:00:42.597
Where is lawyer Jeon?

835
01:00:42.680 --> 01:00:44.098
He is waiting outside.

836
01:00:44.182 --> 01:00:46.768
Will the will be read outside?

837
01:00:46.851 --> 01:00:48.853
We want it to be official.

838
01:00:49.437 --> 01:00:51.898
Of course, there is no point in waiting.

839
01:00:57.320 --> 01:00:58.780
Detective Puck.

840
01:01:22.178 --> 01:01:23.429
Ms. Chu was killed.

841
01:01:27.475 --> 01:01:29.602
It wasn't a heart attack
or medical negligence.

842
01:01:30.186 --> 01:01:31.270
It was murder.

843
01:01:39.153 --> 01:01:40.697
I know why Madame Chu was killed

844
01:01:41.197 --> 01:01:42.782
and why they can kill me.

845
01:01:42.865 --> 01:01:44.325
are you drunk

846
01:01:44.992 --> 01:01:47.453
Why are you making a scene?

847
01:01:48.538 --> 01:01:49.831
<i>Which one of you did it?</i>

848
01:01:50.331 --> 01:01:52.750
<i>You? Are you?</i>

849
01:01:53.835 --> 01:01:54.836
<i>Does…</i>

850
01:01:56.003 --> 01:01:57.046
<i>are you all involved?</i>

851
01:01:57.755 --> 01:01:58.881
Get her out of here.

852
01:02:03.428 --> 01:02:05.430
Move away if you don't want to get hurt.

853
01:02:06.556 --> 01:02:08.391
To Hee, what is it?

854
01:02:08.474 --> 01:02:09.308
What's going on?

855
01:02:09.392 --> 01:02:10.560
Let's start.

856
01:02:10.643 --> 01:02:12.937
Ms To To Hee is required to be present.

857
01:02:22.613 --> 01:02:25.992
Mrs. Choo Jeong-suk left a will,
describing your assets,

858
01:02:26.075 --> 01:02:30.830
including shares and convertible bonds,
along with the deferred condition.

859
01:02:30.913 --> 01:02:31.873
Condition?

860
01:02:32.457 --> 01:02:34.917
Her will is as follows.

861
01:02:36.419 --> 01:02:39.547
"I bequeath all real estate,
including an estate in Hannam-ton

862
01:02:39.630 --> 01:02:42.633
and cash as a donation
"Khansaran Charitable Foundation".

863
01:02:44.010 --> 01:02:46.846
I also bequeath
management rights of "Mire Group",

864
01:02:46.929 --> 01:02:48.723
all shares and subsidiaries

865
01:02:48.806 --> 01:02:50.808
designated heir".

866
01:02:51.934 --> 01:02:55.188
Who is this "designated heir"?

867
01:02:55.688 --> 01:02:58.775
"The designated heir
is the general director of "Mire Nutrition"

868
01:02:58.858 --> 01:03:00.651
To To Hee."

869
01:03:08.618 --> 01:03:09.494
What just happened?

870
01:03:11.078 --> 01:03:12.288
As expected from her.

871
01:03:13.498 --> 01:03:15.541
Is this a surprise party?

872
01:03:16.626 --> 01:03:17.710
"Inheritance

873
01:03:18.336 --> 01:03:21.255
depends on marriage registration
To To Hee for one year

874
01:03:21.339 --> 01:03:24.133
after the death of the heiress, Choo Jung-suk.

875
01:03:27.804 --> 01:03:29.263
If this condition is not met,

876
01:03:29.347 --> 01:03:32.350
her share will pass
"Khansaran Charitable Foundation".

877
01:03:33.184 --> 01:03:34.519
To To Hee…

878
01:03:35.728 --> 01:03:37.021
will be our head?

879
01:03:37.897 --> 01:03:40.316
The deceased also wrote letters
members of her family,

880
01:03:40.399 --> 01:03:43.110
as this news could you
quite shocking.

881
01:03:47.990 --> 01:03:48.991
Let me take a look.

882
01:03:50.076 --> 01:03:51.202
I'm sure there's more.

883
01:03:51.285 --> 01:03:52.787
My mother would do that to me.

884
01:03:55.790 --> 01:03:57.375
"Money has corrupted you all.

885
01:03:57.458 --> 01:03:59.001
Every man in your life…”

886
01:04:00.002 --> 01:04:00.962
Seriously?

887
01:04:01.921 --> 01:04:03.172
What is written there?

888
01:04:07.218 --> 01:04:08.427
You don't want to know that.

889
01:04:16.185 --> 01:04:17.186
Ms. Chu.

890
01:04:19.021 --> 01:04:20.273
What the hell is this?

891
01:04:23.526 --> 01:04:24.944
She made a choice

892
01:04:25.027 --> 01:04:27.154
after serious hesitation.

893
01:04:32.201 --> 01:04:37.331
{\an8}TO TO HI

894
01:04:43.629 --> 01:04:44.463
You!

895
01:04:45.423 --> 01:04:47.967
what did you do

896
01:04:48.050 --> 01:04:49.677
What the hell did you do?

897
01:04:49.760 --> 01:04:52.221
calm down Get yourself together!

898
01:04:52.305 --> 01:04:54.473
You wouldn't agree, would you?

899
01:05:15.036 --> 01:05:16.954
The only way to stop me is

900
01:05:18.289 --> 01:05:19.540
kill me

901
01:05:22.835 --> 01:05:24.128
To Hee

902
01:05:26.505 --> 01:05:28.674
<i>Wait and see, Ms. Chu.</i>

903
01:05:29.258 --> 01:05:31.010
<i>I promise, I will reveal the truth,</i>

904
01:05:31.093 --> 01:05:33.304
<i>even if you have to
join forces with the demon.</i>

905
01:05:50.696 --> 01:05:51.906
Mr. Jeong Koo Won.

906
01:05:53.866 --> 01:05:55.409
marry me

907
01:06:30.236 --> 01:06:32.905
MY BELOVED DEMON

908
01:07:08.149 --> 01:07:09.692
I think you better not get into it.

909
01:07:09.775 --> 01:07:11.068
{\an8}I have to find out who is behind this.

910
01:07:11.152 --> 01:07:12.653
{\an8}<i>To do this, I need to create an audit group.</i>

911
01:07:12.737 --> 01:07:14.405
{\an8}<i>Between Mrs. To and Mr. Jeong.</i>

912
01:07:14.488 --> 01:07:17.825
{\an8}<i>Their communication expresses,
that there is physical intimacy between them.</i>

913
01:07:17.908 --> 01:07:19.869
{\an8}<i>I don't want them to go out alone
and got into trouble.</i>

914
01:07:19.952 --> 01:07:21.454
{\an8}So let me continue
hold your wrist

915
01:07:21.537 --> 01:07:23.039
{\an8}<i>And so they suspect that we are dating.</i>

916
01:07:23.122 --> 01:07:24.999
{\an8}<i>A wonderful day, young Mr. Yi Sun.</i>

917
01:07:25.082 --> 01:07:25.958
{\an8}<i>Young sir!</i>

918
01:07:26.042 --> 01:07:27.460
{\an8}My memories are starting to come back.

919
01:07:27.543 --> 01:07:30.337
{\an8}<i>There is nothing better,
than holding hands</i>in secret

920
01:07:30.421 --> 01:07:31.881
{\an8}<i>under the table at the team lunch.</i>

921
01:07:31.964 --> 01:07:34.925
{\an8}<i>In secret physical touch
there is something so wonderful.</i>

922
01:07:35.009 --> 01:07:36.010
{\an8}I like To To Hee.

923
01:07:40.056 --> 01:07:45.061
Translation of subtitles: Daria Hochel

